          <p>
            Detection is not a single regex. Each request passes through headers, URI patterns, seeded CVE
            signatures, rate and reputation checks, automation detection and session history. A signal can
            add a fixed score, contribute a severity-derived delta, or trigger a hard routing rule.
          </p>
